{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07510","headline":"铜雀台 · 刘长卿","name":"铜雀台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"娇爱更何日，高台空数层。\n含啼映双袖，不忍看西陵。\n漳河东流无复来，百花辇路爲苍苔。\n[青]楼月夜长寂寞，碧云日暮空徘徊。\n君不见邺中万事非昔时，古人不在今人悲。\n春风不逐君王去，草色年年旧宫路。\n宫中歌舞已浮云，空指行人往来处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}